/-!
# Inverse and spanning-tree data for the Fi₂₃ relabeling

`labelInverse` is a candidate left inverse on the range of `labelMap`.
`parent` and `depth` encode the saved orbit tree, pulled back to source labels.
The root is 27192 and all depths are at most 36. These are numerical data;
`Enumeration` checks their inverse and descent identities in Lean's kernel.

Source: the Schreier search in F24G1-p306936B0, followed by the simultaneous
labeling against F23G1-p31671B0. See `source/generate.py` and its retained JSON
witnesses. No external computation is used as a proof.
-/

